{"speciesId":627,"names":{"fr":"Furaiglon","es":"Rufflet","en":"Rufflet","ja":"ワシボン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il casse les Baies avec ses serres. Il combat courageusement, quelle que soit la force de l’adversaire."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"They crush berries with their talons. They bravely stand up to any opponent, no matter how strong it is."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il défie sans discernement même les ennemis puissants. Il devient plus fort en multipliant les combats."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"They will challenge anything, even strong opponents, without fear. Their frequent fights help them become stronger."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It stands up to massive opponents, not out of courage, but out of recklessness. But that is how it gets stronger."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It stands up to massive opponents, not out of courage, but out of recklessness. But that is how it gets stronger."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il casse les Baies avec ses serres. Il combat courageusement, quelle que soit la force de l’adversaire."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Quiebra bayas con sus extremidades. Se enfrenta con valentía a todo enemigo por fuerte que este sea."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"They crush berries with their talons. They bravely stand up to any opponent, no matter how strong it is."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"脚力で 木の実を 砕く。 どんなに 強い 相手でも 勇敢に 立ち向かう 習性。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il défie sans discernement même les ennemis puissants. Il devient plus fort en multipliant les combats."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Desafía indiscriminadamente a rivales poderosos. Librar numerosas batallas lo hace fuerte."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"They will challenge anything, even strong opponents, without fear. Their frequent fights help them become stronger."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"強い 相手にも 見境なく 戦いを 挑む。戦いを 繰り返す ことで 強くなるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il casse les Baies avec ses serres. Il combat courageusement, quelle que soit la force de l’adversaire."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Quiebra bayas con sus extremidades. Se enfrenta con valentía a todo enemigo por fuerte que este sea."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"They crush berries with their talons. They bravely stand up to any opponent, no matter how strong it is."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"脚力で 木の実を 砕く。 どんなに 強い 相手でも 勇敢に 立ち向かう 習性。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il défie sans discernement même les ennemis puissants. Il devient plus fort en multipliant les combats."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Desafía indiscriminadamente a rivales poderosos. Librar numerosas batallas lo hace fuerte."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"They will challenge anything, even strong opponents, without fear. Their frequent fights help them become stronger."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"強い 相手にも 見境なく 戦いを 挑む。戦いを 繰り返す ことで 強くなるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il s’attaque à tout ce qui bouge, sans discrimination. Ses blessures et échecs ne font que le rendre plus fort."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Desafía indiscriminadamente a cualquier rival. Cada vez que le hieren en combate o se debilita no hace sino aumentar su fortaleza."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"They pick fights indiscriminately. They grow stronger and more powerful each time they faint or are injured."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"見境なく 勝負を 挑む。 倒れるたびに 傷つくたびに 強く たくましく 育っていく。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Il agrippe ses proies avec ses serres effilées et les picore. Il lui arrive de manger des Baies, mais au fond c’est un carnivore."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Es un Pokémon carnívoro, aunque no les hace ascos a las bayas. Clava con ahínco sus garras afiladas en la presa para picotearla sin cesar."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"With its sharp claws, this Pokémon pierces its prey, and then it pecks at them. Although it also consumes berries, it’s a carnivore at heart."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"尖ったツメを 獲物に 突き立て ついばんでいる。 木の実も 食べるが 基本的に 肉食の ポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Grâce à ses pattes puissantes et à ses serres robustes, il arrive même à briser la coquille de Kokiyas pour se délecter de son contenu."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"La fuerza de los talones y dureza de las garras le permiten perforar la coraza de los Shellder para picotear su cuerpo."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"With its powerful legs and sturdy claws, it can crack even the hard shells of Shellder and pluck out their insides."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"強い 脚力と 丈夫な ツメで 硬い シェルダーの カラも 砕いて 中身を ついばむ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"C’est un guerrier endurci dès sa naissance. Il commence d’ailleurs par défier ses parents au combat pour leur prouver sa valeur."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Su especie es guerrera y belicosa por naturaleza y lo primero que hacen nada más nacer es medir sus fuerzas contra sus progenitores."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Known as a natural-born warrior, soon after its hatching, it will challenge its parent to a fight in order to gain their acceptance."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"生まれながらの 戦士と 呼ばれる。 生まれて すぐに 親に 挑み 認めてもらわなければ いけない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il ne peut pas s’empêcher de défier les Pokémon qui ont l’air forts. Lorsqu’il perd, il pousse un cri assourdissant."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Cuando ve a un Pokémon de aspecto fuerte, no puede resistirse a desafiarlo en combate. Si pierde, llora y se lamenta a pleno pulmón."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"If it spies a strong Pokémon, Rufflet can’t resist challenging it to a battle. But if Rufflet loses, it starts bawling."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"強そうな ポケモンを 見ると 戦いを 挑まずに いられない。 負けると 大声で 泣きだす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Sa poigne est telle qu’il peut réduire en miettes les plus dures des Baies. Belliqueux de nature, il n’hésite pas à défier tout le monde."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Es capaz de partir hasta la baya más dura gracias a la fuerza de sus extremidades. Belicoso por naturaleza, planta cara a cualquiera."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"A combative Pokémon, it’s ready to pick a fight with anyone. It has talons that can crush hard berries."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"硬い 木の実も 粉々に 砕く 握力。 喧嘩っ早く 誰にでも 勝負を 仕掛ける。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"Its chick-like looks belie its hotheadedness. It challenges its parents at every opportunity, desperate to prove its strength."}],"varieties":[{"id":627,"moves":[{"name":"cut","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0]]},{"name":"wing-attack","learns":[[11,"level-up",10],[14,"level-up",10],[15,"level-up",10],[16,"level-up",10],[17,"level-up",10],[18,"level-up",10],[20,"level-up",12],[25,"level-up",12]]},{"name":"whirlwind","learns":[[11,"level-up",55],[14,"level-up",55],[15,"level-up",55],[16,"level-up",55],[17,"level-up",55],[18,"level-up",55],[20,"level-up",42],[25,"level-up",42]]},{"name":"fly","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fury-attack","learns":[[11,"level-up",5],[14,"level-up",5],[15,"level-up",5],[16,"level-up",5],[17,"level-up",5],[18,"level-up",5]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thrash","learns":[[11,"level-up",64],[14,"level-up",64],[15,"level-up",64]